      "hash": "7738b70282fe18c3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "取暱稱是很有趣……\\n但是也好困難！\\c\\n雖然講究點的暱稱也不錯，\\n還是容易記住的暱稱最好呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t002r0201_system_01",
      "hash": "88f44e42859643ee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "從[VAR COLOR(0006)]Ｘ選單[VAR COLOR(0000)]的同行寶可夢裡\\n選擇寶可夢，\\c\\n就能幫牠們\\n改暱稱了哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t002r0201_childf_01",
      "hash": "7a41034babeb839d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我爸爸也非常\\n喜歡寶可夢呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t002r0201_poke_01",
      "hash": "3ccb7b19aa6a328e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小烈「啾啾！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t002r0201_poster_01",
      "hash": "d7f243d7bd4dd38e",
